<title>SINGAPORE: Sin Soon Huat directors sell shares.</title>
<headline>Sin Soon Huat directors sell shares.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four directors of Sin Soon Huat informed the Stock Exchange of Singapore on Monday they sold a total of 18.7 million company shares.</p>
<p>The shares of the industrial hardware maker were sold at Singapore 0.735 cents each.</p>
<p>Sin Soon Huat topped the actives in trade with about 46 million shares changing hands.</p>
<p>Dealers said it included about 44 million shares crossed at S$0.73 and S$0.735.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
